 r. Van Orden’s Grand Rounds talk (December 10th 12-1pm PT\, available on
 ly to members of the Department of Psychiatry and Behavioral Sciences) wil
 l explore key dimensions of social connection that are related to late-lif
 e suicide and how they are commonly assessed. She will also lay out opport
 unities and challenges of technology-supported assessments and interventio
 ns for improving social connection in later life.
